---
// Two ways to update the status bar over three updates: replace (old status removed, the suffix after it recomputed) vs persistent append (nothing invalidated, stale statuses pile up), with the break-even rule.
---

<svg
	class="dg"
	viewBox="0 0 720 700"
	role="img"
	aria-labelledby="d2-rva-title d2-rva-desc"
	style="min-width: 630px"
>
	<title id="d2-rva-title">Replace each round vs persistent append</title>
	<desc id="d2-rva-desc">
		Two lanes of the same trajectory over three status updates. Each row shows the context at one update: a cached
		prefix, the messages R added between updates, and status messages S. Implementation 1, replace each round: at
		update 1 the context is prefix, R1 and the new status S1. At update 2, S1 is removed, so R2, which came after it,
		is recomputed, and the new status S2 is appended. At update 3, S2 is removed, R1 and R2 stay cached, R3 is
		recomputed, and S3 is appended. Only one current status is ever in the context. Implementation 2, persistent
		append: at update 1 the context is prefix, R1 and S1. At update 2, S1 stays as a stale status, R2 is cached and S2
		is appended. At update 3, S1 and S2 are both stale, R3 is cached and S3 is appended. Nothing is invalidated, but
		stale statuses accumulate. Legend: cached, recomputed, new status, stale status. Footer: prefer append when
		alpha times S times N over 2 is less than (1 minus alpha) times R, where S is the tokens per status, R the tokens
		added between updates, N the expected number of updates and alpha the cost of cached input relative to regular
		input.
	</desc>

	<text x="2" y="28" class="dg-title">Updating the status: replace vs append</text>

	<g class="dg-container dg-neutral">
		<rect x="4" y="44" width="712" height="246" rx="12"></rect>
		<text x="20" y="70" font-weight="700">Implementation 1: replace each round</text>
		<text x="20" y="92" class="dg-sub">one current status; the suffix after the removed one is recomputed</text>
	</g>
	<g class="dg-container dg-neutral">
		<rect x="4" y="306" width="712" height="246" rx="12"></rect>
		<text x="20" y="332" font-weight="700">Implementation 2: persistent append</text>
		<text x="20" y="354" class="dg-sub">prefix stays stable; stale statuses accumulate</text>
	</g>

	<!-- Update 1 -->
	<g data-step="1" data-step-label="Update 1: both lanes append the first status S1 after R1">
		<text x="20" y="138" font-weight="700">Update 1</text>
		<g class="dg-node dg-context">
			<rect x="100" y="106" width="76" height="52" rx="6"></rect>
			<text x="108" y="128" font-weight="700">prefix</text>
			<text x="108" y="148" class="dg-sub">cached</text>
		</g>
		<g class="dg-node dg-context">
			<rect x="182" y="106" width="108" height="52" rx="6"></rect>
			<text x="190" y="128" font-weight="700">R1</text>
			<text x="190" y="148" class="dg-sub">cached</text>
		</g>
		<g class="dg-node dg-harness">
			<rect x="296" y="106" width="56" height="52" rx="6"></rect>
			<text x="304" y="128" class="dg-accent" font-weight="700">S1</text>
			<text x="304" y="148" class="dg-sub">new</text>
		</g>
		<text x="20" y="400" font-weight="700">Update 1</text>
		<g class="dg-node dg-context">
			<rect x="100" y="368" width="76" height="52" rx="6"></rect>
			<text x="108" y="390" font-weight="700">prefix</text>
			<text x="108" y="410" class="dg-sub">cached</text>
		</g>
		<g class="dg-node dg-context">
			<rect x="182" y="368" width="108" height="52" rx="6"></rect>
			<text x="190" y="390" font-weight="700">R1</text>
			<text x="190" y="410" class="dg-sub">cached</text>
		</g>
		<g class="dg-node dg-harness">
			<rect x="296" y="368" width="56" height="52" rx="6"></rect>
			<text x="304" y="390" class="dg-accent" font-weight="700">S1</text>
			<text x="304" y="410" class="dg-sub">new</text>
		</g>
	</g>

	<!-- Update 2 -->
	<g data-step="2" data-step-label="Update 2: replace removes S1, so R2 after it is recomputed; append keeps S1 as stale and adds S2">
		<text x="20" y="198" font-weight="700">Update 2</text>
		<g class="dg-node dg-context">
			<rect x="100" y="166" width="76" height="52" rx="6"></rect>
			<text x="108" y="188" font-weight="700">prefix</text>
			<text x="108" y="208" class="dg-sub">cached</text>
		</g>
		<g class="dg-node dg-context">
			<rect x="182" y="166" width="108" height="52" rx="6"></rect>
			<text x="190" y="188" font-weight="700">R1</text>
			<text x="190" y="208" class="dg-sub">cached</text>
		</g>
		<g class="dg-node dg-guard">
			<rect x="296" y="166" width="108" height="52" rx="6"></rect>
			<text x="304" y="188" class="dg-accent" font-weight="700">R2</text>
			<text x="304" y="208" class="dg-sub">recomputed</text>
		</g>
		<g class="dg-node dg-harness">
			<rect x="410" y="166" width="56" height="52" rx="6"></rect>
			<text x="418" y="188" class="dg-accent" font-weight="700">S2</text>
			<text x="418" y="208" class="dg-sub">new</text>
		</g>
		<text x="478" y="198" class="dg-sub">S1 removed → R2 recomputed</text>
		<text x="20" y="460" font-weight="700">Update 2</text>
		<g class="dg-node dg-context">
			<rect x="100" y="428" width="76" height="52" rx="6"></rect>
			<text x="108" y="450" font-weight="700">prefix</text>
			<text x="108" y="470" class="dg-sub">cached</text>
		</g>
		<g class="dg-node dg-context">
			<rect x="182" y="428" width="108" height="52" rx="6"></rect>
			<text x="190" y="450" font-weight="700">R1</text>
			<text x="190" y="470" class="dg-sub">cached</text>
		</g>
		<g class="dg-node dg-neutral">
			<rect x="296" y="428" width="56" height="52" rx="6"></rect>
			<text x="304" y="450" font-weight="700">S1</text>
			<text x="304" y="470" class="dg-sub">stale</text>
		</g>
		<g class="dg-node dg-context">
			<rect x="358" y="428" width="108" height="52" rx="6"></rect>
			<text x="366" y="450" font-weight="700">R2</text>
			<text x="366" y="470" class="dg-sub">cached</text>
		</g>
		<g class="dg-node dg-harness">
			<rect x="472" y="428" width="56" height="52" rx="6"></rect>
			<text x="480" y="450" class="dg-accent" font-weight="700">S2</text>
			<text x="480" y="470" class="dg-sub">new</text>
		</g>
	</g>

	<!-- Update 3 -->
	<g data-step="3" data-step-label="Update 3: replace removes S2 and recomputes R3; append now carries two stale statuses">
		<text x="20" y="258" font-weight="700">Update 3</text>
		<g class="dg-node dg-context">
			<rect x="100" y="226" width="76" height="52" rx="6"></rect>
			<text x="108" y="248" font-weight="700">prefix</text>
			<text x="108" y="268" class="dg-sub">cached</text>
		</g>
		<g class="dg-node dg-context">
			<rect x="182" y="226" width="108" height="52" rx="6"></rect>
			<text x="190" y="248" font-weight="700">R1</text>
			<text x="190" y="268" class="dg-sub">cached</text>
		</g>
		<g class="dg-node dg-context">
			<rect x="296" y="226" width="108" height="52" rx="6"></rect>
			<text x="304" y="248" font-weight="700">R2</text>
			<text x="304" y="268" class="dg-sub">cached</text>
		</g>
		<g class="dg-node dg-guard">
			<rect x="410" y="226" width="108" height="52" rx="6"></rect>
			<text x="418" y="248" class="dg-accent" font-weight="700">R3</text>
			<text x="418" y="268" class="dg-sub">recomputed</text>
		</g>
		<g class="dg-node dg-harness">
			<rect x="524" y="226" width="56" height="52" rx="6"></rect>
			<text x="532" y="248" class="dg-accent" font-weight="700">S3</text>
			<text x="532" y="268" class="dg-sub">new</text>
		</g>
		<text x="592" y="258" class="dg-sub">S2 removed</text>
		<text x="20" y="520" font-weight="700">Update 3</text>
		<g class="dg-node dg-context">
			<rect x="100" y="488" width="76" height="52" rx="6"></rect>
			<text x="108" y="510" font-weight="700">prefix</text>
			<text x="108" y="530" class="dg-sub">cached</text>
		</g>
		<g class="dg-node dg-context">
			<rect x="182" y="488" width="108" height="52" rx="6"></rect>
			<text x="190" y="510" font-weight="700">R1</text>
			<text x="190" y="530" class="dg-sub">cached</text>
		</g>
		<g class="dg-node dg-neutral">
			<rect x="296" y="488" width="56" height="52" rx="6"></rect>
			<text x="304" y="510" font-weight="700">S1</text>
			<text x="304" y="530" class="dg-sub">stale</text>
		</g>
		<g class="dg-node dg-context">
			<rect x="358" y="488" width="108" height="52" rx="6"></rect>
			<text x="366" y="510" font-weight="700">R2</text>
			<text x="366" y="530" class="dg-sub">cached</text>
		</g>
		<g class="dg-node dg-neutral">
			<rect x="472" y="488" width="56" height="52" rx="6"></rect>
			<text x="480" y="510" font-weight="700">S2</text>
			<text x="480" y="530" class="dg-sub">stale</text>
		</g>
		<g class="dg-node dg-context">
			<rect x="534" y="488" width="108" height="52" rx="6"></rect>
			<text x="542" y="510" font-weight="700">R3</text>
			<text x="542" y="530" class="dg-sub">cached</text>
		</g>
		<g class="dg-node dg-harness">
			<rect x="648" y="488" width="56" height="52" rx="6"></rect>
			<text x="656" y="510" class="dg-accent" font-weight="700">S3</text>
			<text x="656" y="530" class="dg-sub">new</text>
		</g>
	</g>

	<!-- Legend -->
	<g class="dg-node dg-context">
		<rect x="4" y="568" width="164" height="36" rx="6"></rect>
		<text x="20" y="592">cached</text>
	</g>
	<g class="dg-node dg-guard">
		<rect x="186" y="568" width="164" height="36" rx="6"></rect>
		<text x="202" y="592">recomputed</text>
	</g>
	<g class="dg-node dg-harness">
		<rect x="368" y="568" width="164" height="36" rx="6"></rect>
		<text x="384" y="592">new status</text>
	</g>
	<g class="dg-node dg-neutral">
		<rect x="550" y="568" width="166" height="36" rx="6"></rect>
		<text x="566" y="592">stale status</text>
	</g>

	<text x="4" y="640" class="dg-mono" font-weight="700">prefer append when α·S·N/2 &lt; (1−α)·R</text>
	<text x="4" y="664" class="dg-sub">S: tokens per status · R: tokens added between updates</text>
	<text x="4" y="688" class="dg-sub">N: expected updates · α: cached input cost ÷ regular input cost</text>
</svg>
